<title>UK: UK's natural gas pricing system faces major overhaul.</title>
<headline>UK's natural gas pricing system faces major overhaul.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>A major change to the structure of Britain's natural gas physical pricing system is under consideration and the National Balancing Point, where around 90 percent of all UK gas is traded, may be phased out, a senior executive at regulator Ofgas said on Wednesday.</p>
